  "description": "Bowire protocol plugin for Rheinmetall's TacticalAPI — a gRPC interface for situational-awareness systems. Bundles the upstream service schema so users get typed discovery and invoke against any TacticalAPI server, even when gRPC Server Reflection is disabled. The TacticalAPI .proto files (EPL-2.0) are downloaded at build time from the upstream repository and never redistributed by this Apache-2.0 package — only the generated C# bindings ship.",
